SUMMARY:Let’s Paint! Summer Landscape in Watercolor: Grades 1-3 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Your child in grades 1-3 will enjoy an afternoon of experimenting with watercolor to create beautiful summer landscapes! We will experiment with different techniques to create unique artworks for you to celebrate the colors and textures of summer. This is a studio based class with lots of guidance to start followed by one-on-one instruction. Expect to have lots of creative freedom within the bounds of the assignment! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lets-paint-summer-landscape-in-watercolor-grades-1-3-at-pcad/
