SUMMARY:"Tapestry" Art Exhibit Opening at Third Story
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a celebration of the opening of “Tapestry\,” an exhibition featuring the works of nearly 40 artists\, interpreting the theme literally and metaphorically. This exhibit highlights the threads that connect us to one another and to the earth.  Among other interpretations\, visitors can expect to see traditional and unconventional use of textiles\, paintings expressing the beauty of the natural world\, mixed media ruminations on memory\, and sculpture representing the joy of friendship. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/tapestry-art-exhibit-opening-at-third-story/
