SUMMARY:Stars and Stripes Forever: Celebrating 250 Years of American Music
DESCRIPTION:Join Allegro Orchestra for an afternoon celebrating 250 years of American music! From Bernstein and Copland to Florence Price and John Williams\, and of course including the iconic John Phillip Sousa’s “Stars and Stripes Forever\,” this concert will inspire appreciation and love for the rich history of music in the USA! \n\nThe full Allegro Orchestra will fill the hall of Barshinger Center with joyful music! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Learn More
